The '''Twinstars''' are an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that can be obtained by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Cyber Academy Galaxy Gals (Gacha Event)|Cyber Academy Galaxy Gals]] event. They were added in [[Version 6.2 Update|Version 6.2]] on June 27th, 2017. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 8.1 Update|Version 8.1]] decreases recharge time, increases speed and damage and grants [[Immune to Weaken|Weaken Immunity]]. [[Talents]] were added in [[Version 12.2 Update|Version 12.2]], and Ultra Talents were added in [[Version 15.1 Update|Version 15.1]].

