==Trivia==
*Their True Form was originally called "Ultima Twinstars, type Φ", but was later changed to "Divine Twinstars" in [[Version 9.1 Update|Version 9.1]], and then changed once again in [[Version 15.3 Update|Version 15.3]] to "Divine Twinstars Φ".
**The Google Play Store [https://youtu.be/84HcqmPWl0A trailer] still uses their True Form's original name.
*In the Japanese version, the Twinstars are known by their individual names, being Shishiru and Komari.
*The Φ in their Evolved/True Form's name is the Greek letter "Phi".
*The two kanji in their Evolved and True Form designs,「阿」and「吽」, are likely derived from the idiom「阿吽の呼吸」(''aun no kokyū'') used in the Japanese Normal Form description, which means to be perfectly synchronized.
*They may also be a reference to the physical representation and pronunciation of अहूँ, the Sixth Pāramitā, 阿吽 in Chinese and pronounced a-hūṃ, where A is the sound made with the mouth fully opened and hūṃ is the sound made with the mouth closed. In Buddhist statues, A and Hūṃ would appear in pairs with A always having their mouth open while the other always closed, same with how the Twinstars appear in game.
*They may be a reference to the anime "Onmyoji Two Stars" (Jap. Sousei no Onmyouji), where the 50th series is called "Two Stars. Twins", as well as the second name of the anime "Twin Star Exorcists".
*They are the only unit from Galaxy Gals to appear as two people.

